{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yKJPUcSCok1795815284.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>筲箕灣凌晨有住宅單位懷疑拖板過熱引發火警，一名住客輕傷。</p><p></p><p>事發於凌晨約兩時警方接報指，筲箕灣愛蝶灣一個低層單位發生火警。消防開喉撲救，將火警列為一級。據了解起火位置為單位睡房，懷疑因拖板過熱而起火。約二百多名居民自行疏散到戶外安全位置。一名男住客背部燒傷，送往東區醫院治理，另外有居民吸入濃煙不適，同樣送院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T22:44:19.205032+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T21:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T08:29:26.739329+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T22:37:35.630072+00:00","content_hash":"95f032a2120b697f1d7464ba0c47e4327289edf96e6d0ddb2c86ce4ccbb3d08c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}